                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Overall you get what youd expect from a $5 VR game. would be great for kids to play, very basic, easy on the eyes, and doesnt require any skill.\n\nOnly reccomending this game beause of the cheap price and the potential for improvement.\n\nPros:\nSMASH THINGS\nRuns smooth\npicking up and punching cars is mid air is fun.\n\nCons\nNot enough destruction\ngraphics could be improved\nNo enemies\n\n\nTo improve this game i would suggest just adding a few enemies and more destructable environments. it is a start to what could be a very fun game.\n\n\nhere is my gameplay, this was my second run as the first run the statue of libertys torch got stuck in mid air and i couldnt get it lol\n\nhttps://youtu.be/M2aNcsOc-mc",
